<mjml><mj-head><!-- VISIBILITY_STYLES --><mj-style>
      /* Desktop-first : les clients qui ne supportent pas @media
         (Outlook Web, Nouveau Outlook) gardent le comportement desktop. */
      .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
        display: block;
        width: auto;
        max-height: none;
        overflow: visible;
        line-height: inherit;
      }
      .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
        display: none;
        width: 0;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        line-height: 0;
      }
      /* Mobile : afficher mobile-only, masquer desktop-only */
      @media only screen and (max-width:599px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
      }
      /* Desktop explicit (pour spécificité) */
      @media only screen and (min-width:600px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
      /* Fallback : vrais appareils mobiles (Outlook mobile peut avoir un viewport &gt;600px) */
      @media only screen and (max-device-width:599px) {
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
    </mj-style><!--[if mso | IE]>
      <style type="text/css">
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        table.desktop-only, table.desktop-only-outlook, table[class*="desktop-only"],
        tr.desktop-only, tr.desktop-only-outlook, tr[class*="desktop-only"],
        td.desktop-only, td.desktop-only-outlook, td[class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: table !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        table.mobile-only, table.mobile-only-outlook, table[class*="mobile-only"],
        tr.mobile-only, tr.mobile-only-outlook, tr[class*="mobile-only"],
        td.mobile-only, td.mobile-only-outlook, td[class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      </style>
    <![endif]--><mj-attributes><mj-all padding="0">
            </mj-all></mj-attributes><mj-font name="Lora" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap"></mj-font><mj-font name="Caveat" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@600&display=swap"></mj-font><mj-style>@media only screen and (max-width:479px){.h2 div{font-size:26px!important;line-height:32px!important;}}</mj-style><mj-preview>Une chambre au chaud, un bon dîner, rien à prévoir.</mj-preview></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#E9EEF1" width="600px"><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0"><mj-column><mj-image css-class="tf-logo" src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/fetes-logo-ardoise.png" alt="{{facility_name}}" align="center" width="150px" padding="26px 30px 20px 30px"></mj-image></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-image src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/fetes-cocooning-600.jpg" alt="Une chambre en bois, au chaud, sous la neige" padding="0"></mj-image></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0"><mj-column><mj-text css-class="h2" font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="30px" line-height="36px" color="#2F4858" padding="38px 52px 22px 52px"><div>Décembre, la saison du cocooning</div></mj-text><mj-text font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="17px" line-height="28px" color="#2B2B2B" padding="0 52px 8px 52px"><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Bonjour {{firstname}},</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Dehors, il fait froid. Chez nous, le feu est allumé. Nous gardons pour vous une chambre au chaud, un bon dîner et la vraie paresse des week-ends d'avant les fêtes.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Rien à prévoir, rien à organiser. Vous arrivez, nous nous occupons du reste.</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="10px 52px 8px 52px"><mj-column background-color="#F5F7F8" border-left="4px solid #B96B45"><mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16px" line-height="26px" color="#2B2B2B" padding="18px 22px"><p style="margin:0;"><strong>Votre escapade</strong><br/>Les nuits de [[Période|début décembre]] : [[Votre formule|une nuit, un dîner et le petit-déjeuner]].<br/>Votre avantage : [[Avantage|un verre de bienvenue offert]].<br/><span style="color:#B5452D;">Offre valable jusqu'au [[Date limite|15 décembre]].</span></p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0"><mj-column><mj-button href="{{booking_page_url}}" align="left" background-color="#2F4858" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="4px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" inner-padding="16px 34px" padding="28px 52px 8px 52px">Réserver mon week-end</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0"><mj-column><mj-text font-family="Lora, Georgia, serif" font-size="17px" line-height="26px" color="#2B2B2B" padding="34px 52px 0 52px"><p style="margin:0;">À très bientôt,</p></mj-text><mj-text font-family="Caveat, 'Brush Script MT', cursive" font-size="44px" line-height="48px" color="#B96B45" padding="6px 52px 0 52px"><p style="margin:0;">[[Prénom du directeur|Claire]]</p></mj-text><mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="20px" color="#5B6770" padding="0 52px 40px 52px"><p style="margin:0;">[[Fonction|Directrice]] et toute l'équipe de {{facility_name}}</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="12px" line-height="19px" color="#5B6770" padding="26px 36px 34px 36px"><p style="margin:0;">{{facility_name}}, {{facility_address}}, {{facility_zip_code}} {{facility_city}}<br/>Vous recevez ce message parce que vous avez déjà échangé avec nous. <a href="{{unsubscribe_link}}" style="color:#2F4858;text-decoration:underline;">Se désinscrire</a></p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>